<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<project source="https://github.com/logisim-evolution/logisim-evolution" version="1.0">
    <lib name="0" url="builtin/gates.xml"/>
    <lib name="1" url="builtin/pins.xml"/>
    <lib name="2" url="builtin/memory.xml"/>
    <main name="main"/>
    <circuit name="Excess3Plus1">
        <info>
        ПРЕОБРАЗОВАТЕЛЬ EXCESS-3 -&gt; EXCESS-3+1 (n=1)

        Входы: X8, X4, X2, X1 (Excess-3 код числа 0-9)
        Выходы: Y8, Y4, Y2, Y1 (Excess-3+1), Carry (переполнение)

        ЛОГИЧЕСКИЕ ВЫРАЖЕНИЯ:

        Y8 = !X8&amp;X4&amp;!X2&amp;!X1 | !X8&amp;X4&amp;!X2&amp;X1 | !X8&amp;X4&amp;X2&amp;!X1 | !X8&amp;X4&amp;X2&amp;X1 | X8&amp;!X4&amp;!X2&amp;!X1
        Y4 = !X8&amp;!X4&amp;!X2&amp;!X1 | !X8&amp;!X4&amp;!X2&amp;X1 | !X8&amp;!X4&amp;X2&amp;!X1 | !X8&amp;!X4&amp;X2&amp;X1 | X8&amp;!X4&amp;!X2&amp;!X1
        Y2 = !X8&amp;!X4&amp;X2&amp;!X1 | !X8&amp;!X4&amp;X2&amp;X1 | !X8&amp;X4&amp;X2&amp;!X1 | !X8&amp;X4&amp;X2&amp;X1
        Y1 = !X8&amp;!X4&amp;!X2&amp;X1 | !X8&amp;!X4&amp;X2&amp;X1 | !X8&amp;X4&amp;!X2&amp;X1 | !X8&amp;X4&amp;X2&amp;X1
        Carry = X8&amp;!X4&amp;!X2&amp;X1

        ПРИМЕРЫ:
        0 (0011) -&gt; 1 (0100)
        5 (1000) -&gt; 6 (1001)
        9 (1100) -&gt; 10 (0000) + Carry=1
        </info>
    </circuit>
</project>